column2:
Here is a vote on what you would like me to finish working on. I will have a couple of game below and you can tell me in the comments what I should work on and I will add your username below that game. Only one game per person.\
\
Right now Time is in first with 7 points! \
\
-------------------------------------\
1. Pong - the Original \
98% complete\
This is not the best pong game, just a attempt on making the pong the most original as possible. It is just like the pong that came out in 1972, but you can play 2 player or against the AI at Easy, Med, or Hard.\
\
Votes:\
@TRI_NATION\
-------------------------------------\
\
2. Time - a Scrolling platformer\
99% complete\
Just a cool Scrolling platformer that you are timed at, and see if you can get the highscore!\
\
Votes:\
@All-Star-soccer\
@Exchidsz\
@PBroLikesDoy\
@PDDJ\
@scratchpotato17\
@EndZone99\
@Atten007\
-------------------------------------\
\
3. Asteroids - the Original\
35% complete\
A asteroids game just like the one that came out in 1979.\
\
Votes:\
@superfireninja9\
@apen300\
@poliswag21\
-------------------------------------\
\
4. The Periodic Table of Elements\
10% complete\
A periodic table of elements that you can click on and get information on each element and here how to pronounce it.\
\
Votes:\
@alanthehero\
@46009361\
-------------------------------------\
\
5. Create\
7% complete\
A game that you can get different materials and create your own scrolling platformer. You can also save and share level codes.\
\
Votes: \
@Koliod\
@cubbywindowsdpc\
@Happyman555\
@adav1917\
